#: ../../source/user-guide/metrics/metrics.md:91
msgid ""
"Most UCM metrics appear only after their corresponding code path has run."
" When there is no external-storage hit, only a small subset of metrics "
"may be present."
msgstr ""
"大多数 UCM 指标只会在相应的代码路径执行后出现。当没有外部存储命中时，可能只有"
"一小部分指标存在。"

